m-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"marketable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Marketable</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"value\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Value</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">2,000 - 4,000 gp</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"npcvalue\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Sold for</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">2,000 gp</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"npcprice\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Bought for</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">(not sold by NPCs)</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Field Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"walkable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Blocking</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">8.00<br/><span class=\"implementation-date\">June 26, 2007<br/>Summer Update 2007</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\">See also: Objects<span class=\"explained\">Help</span></nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-intro\">\n<div id=\"w-object-profile\">\n<div id=\"w-twbox-image\"><img alt=\"latest?cb=20070618235319&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Shard_ad76d1.gif\"/></div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-look\"><div class=\"item-look tibiatext tibiagreen\">You see a shard.<div class=\"p-weight\">It weighs 19.00 oz.</div><div class=\"p-flavortext\">It is a shattered part of the Frostheart Spire.</div><br/></div></div>\n<div class=\"\" id=\"w-twbox-sounds\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-object-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p>This shard is told to bear great magical powers, namely used to fuel great frost magic, whose magic has been mastered by the <a href=\"#/wiki/Nibelor\">Nibelor</a> shamans. It's a part of the Frostheart Spire.\n</p><p><b>Note:</b> This item can only be sold after having obtained both addons of the <a href=\"#/wiki/Norseman%20Outfits\">Norseman Outfit</a>.\n</p><p><br/>\n</p>\n<ul><li>15 are needed for both addons of the <a href=\"#/quest/norseman-outfits-quest\">Norseman Outfits Quest</a>.</li>\n<li>1 can be obtained in the <a href=\"#/quest/skeleton-decoration-quest\">Skeleton Decoration Quest</a>.</li>\n<li>1 can be obtained in the <a href=\"#/quest/frost-dragon-quest\">Frost Dragon Quest</a>.</li>\n<li>1 can be obtained in the Chakoya Camp Quest.</li>\n<li>1 can be obtained in the Formorgar Mine Quest.</li>\n<li>1 can be obtained in the <a href=\"#/quest/lion-trophy-quest\">Lion Trophy Quest</a>.</li>\n<li>1 can be obtained in the <a href=\"#/quest/berserk-potion-quest\">Berserk Potion Quest</a>.</li>\n<li>5 can be obtained in the <a href=\"#/quest/sinatuki-quest\">Sinatuki Quest</a>.</li></ul>\n</div>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-item-droppedby\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Dropped_By\">Dropped By</span></h3>\n<div class=\"item-droppedby-wrapper\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Barbarian%20Bloodwalker\">Barbarian Bloodwalker</a></li>\n<li><a hr